Cell["2. Matching", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a4bdf420-fcce-9c44-8cf1-f86a65ec87ee"],

Cell["\<\
Before anything is rewritten, the input has to be found. \
HypergraphRuleMatches gives the ways it sits inside a hypergraph, and nothing \
else:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f04a9d5b-032b-3747-a5b5-b23294cb4b3e"],

